{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_78_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_78","textTraditional":"一、十有五年，春王正月，公如齊。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_78_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_78","textTraditional":"二、楚人伐徐。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_78_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_78","textTraditional":"三、三月，公會齊侯、宋公、陳侯、衞侯、鄭伯、許男、曹伯盟于牡丘，遂次于匡。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_78_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_78","textTraditional":"四、公孫敖率師及諸侯之大夫救徐。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_78_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_78","textTraditional":"五、夏五月，日有食之。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_78_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_78","textTraditional":"六、秋七月，齊師、曹師伐厲。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_78_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_78","textTraditional":"七、八月〈虫衆〉。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_78_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_78","textTraditional":"八、九月，公至自會。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_78_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_78","textTraditional":"桓公之會不致，此何以致？久也。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_cdt_78_10","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_78","textTraditional":"九、季姬歸于鄫。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_cdt_78_11","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_78","textTraditional":"十、己卯晦，震夷伯之廟。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_cdt_78_12","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_78","textTraditional":"晦者何？冥也。震之者何？雷電擊夷伯之廟者也。夷伯者，曷為者也？季氏之孚也。季氏之孚則微者，其稱夷伯何？大之也。曷為大之？天戒之，故大之也。何以書？記異也。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_cdt_78_13","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_78","textTraditional":"十一、冬，宋人伐曹。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_cdt_78_14","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_78","textTraditional":"十二、楚人敗徐于婁林。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_cdt_78_15","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_78","textTraditional":"十三、十有一月壬戌，晉侯及秦伯戰于韓，獲晉侯。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_cdt_78_16","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_78","textTraditional":"此偏戰也，何以不言師敗績？君獲，不言師敗績也。","sentenceOrder":16}],"overrides":{}}